UniFi API documentation (not covered by the MIT License)
--------------------------------------------------------
tests/fixtures/openapi/ holds the OpenAPI documents of Ubiquiti's public
UniFi developer documentation (developer.ui.com), stored unchanged as
input and test fixtures for the code generator. They are the property of
Ubiquiti Inc. and subject to its terms. They are included only for
interoperability and testing; they are NOT licensed under the MIT License
of this project, and no rights in them are granted by this repository.

The code generator (src/codegen/, npm run codegen) reads that
documentation from developer.ui.com. Tool names, descriptions, parameter
names, parameter descriptions and request body schemas in
src/tools/generated/ are derived from it.

